=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3f42e68d788276d15aeae56f9be2e6ef 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "パンツスーツタイプのナース服でムチムチなせいで下に着てるシンプルなスポブラとショーツがうっすら透けてるムチムチメスケモお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@selamics1/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d731288d/requests/107819_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e99429f5a4d427fc237ed364179a757c", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d731288d/requests/107819_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e99429f5a4d427fc237ed364179a757c, https://si.imgix.net/d731288d/requests/107819_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5c284961ddfd14fbe83a47709c26703a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d731288d/requests/107819_0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=80f25514ed2b9dd7335da8c19adc7667 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "ワンピースを着ているのにお酒に酔って下着丸見えね寝ちゃってるめんつゆちゃんをお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@selamics1/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c8550fd6/requests/75356_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b40a70d7acb8e38a6893c99765ad49cc", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c8550fd6/requests/75356_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b40a70d7acb8e38a6893c99765ad49cc, https://si.imgix.net/c8550fd6/requests/75356_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74a53e6b01965c570c269d3e89a47cab 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c8550fd6/requests/75356_1?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=93439626f04f23f5f75ba5b02e9f9f8b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "パンダママが昔の体操服（ブルマ）を着てみたらものすごいムチムチだけどなんとかいけるじゃん・・・！的な感じでお願いします！", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}]}